# 32. Common Mistakes I Made

## Mistake 1 — Wrong CSS unit

Wrong:

    gap: 20x;

Correct:

    gap: 20px;

---

## Mistake 2 — Missing semicolon

Wrong:

    padding: 20px

Correct:

    padding: 20px;

---

## Mistake 3 — Putting heading inside Flexbox container

If we write:

    <div class="container">
        <h2>My Skills</h2>
        <div class="box">Java</div>
    </div>

`My Skills` becomes a Flexbox item.

Better:

    <h2 class="section-title">My Skills</h2>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="box">Java</div>
    </div>

The heading stays separate from the Flexbox items.

---

## Mistake 4 — Forgetting the CSS file

If HTML contains:

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

but `style.css` doesn't exist, the styling won't appear.

Correct folder:

    Day2/
    ├── index.html
    └── style.css

---

## Mistake 5 — Putting HTML tags inside CSS

Wrong:

    <style>
        ...
    </style>

inside `style.css`.

Correct:

    h1 {
        color: blue;
    }

